invariant: INV-14
file: src/srv_resume.c
catches: srv_flight_test
reason: the server seals new tickets under ticket_key_previous, the key
  the caller retires at the next key change, so each new ticket dies one
  key change early. srv_cfg.h seals under ticket_key alone, and
  test/srv_resume_issue_tests.h opens the issued ticket under ticket_key
  (docs/decisions.md 220).

--- old
    size_t ticket_len = srv_ticket_seal(widemul_answer(&t->cfg), t->cfg.srv.ticket_key, nonce, &c,
--- new
    size_t ticket_len = srv_ticket_seal(widemul_answer(&t->cfg),
                                        t->cfg.srv.ticket_key_previous != NULL
                                            ? t->cfg.srv.ticket_key_previous
                                            : t->cfg.srv.ticket_key,
                                        nonce, &c,
